Third-party notices

- The single-pass gather bokeh depth of field follows a technique published by Dennis Gustafsson
  ("Bokeh depth of field in a single pass", blog.voxagon.se, 2018). The algorithm was reimplemented from the
  description; no code was copied.
- hash12 in the grade shader is "Hash without Sine" by Dave Hoskins (MIT License,
  https://www.shadertoy.com/view/4djSRW), Copyright (c) 2014 David Hoskins.
- Interleaved gradient noise constants are a published formula by Jorge Jimenez (SIGGRAPH 2014 course talk on
  next-generation post-processing).
- GTAOPass, UnrealBloomPass, FullScreenQuad and RoomEnvironment are three.js addons (MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2010-2026 three.js authors), imported from the `three` package, not copied here.
